@startuml
title RF12 — Estádio (aberto ou coberto), setores e ingressos · Máquina de estados: StadiumSector (obra e operação)
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "Comprado" as PLANNED
PLANNED : ledger STADIUM debitado
state "Em obra" as UNDER_CONSTRUCTION
UNDER_CONSTRUCTION : semanas de obra > 0
UNDER_CONSTRUCTION : não vende ingressos
state "Operacional" as OPERATIONAL
OPERATIONAL : condition ≥ 40
OPERATIONAL : preço e carnês ativos
state "Degradado" as DEGRADED
DEGRADED : condition < 40
DEGRADED : atmosfera e ocupação menores
state "Em reforma" as RENOVATING
RENOVATING : condition → 100 ao concluir
state "Removido" as REMOVED
REMOVED : capacidade recalculada (≥ 60 mil)
[*] --> PLANNED
PLANNED --> UNDER_CONSTRUCTION : obra iniciada
UNDER_CONSTRUCTION --> OPERATIONAL : obra concluída (Scheduler)
OPERATIONAL --> DEGRADED : desgaste por jogo em casa
DEGRADED --> RENOVATING : PUT renovate
OPERATIONAL --> RENOVATING : PUT renovate / amplia
RENOVATING --> OPERATIONAL : obra concluída
OPERATIONAL --> REMOVED : DELETE
DEGRADED --> REMOVED : DELETE
REMOVED --> [*]
@enduml
